# Investor Portal — TokenRealty Frontend

Human docs: [docs/rules/investor-portal.md](../../docs/rules/investor-portal.md), [docs/rules/api-gateway-bff.md](../../docs/rules/api-gateway-bff.md).

## Stack

React 19 + TypeScript, Vite, TanStack Query, React Router, wagmi/viem, Tailwind.

## Rules

- All API calls through gateway — `VITE_API_BASE_URL` or Vite proxy `/api` → `:8080`
- JWT in `AuthProvider` / sessionStorage; attach `Authorization: Bearer` in `lib/api.ts`
- Prefer BFF: `/v1/bff/flats/{id}`, `/v1/bff/listings/{id}` over multi-service fetches
- Types in `src/types/api.ts` — keep aligned with Java DTOs / BffDtos
- No private keys or secrets in frontend code or env
- Buy flow: `POST /v1/orders` requires `buyerWallet` — wagmi address or profile wallet
- Match shadcn-style components in `components/ui/`; use `cn()` from `lib/utils.ts`

## Do not

- Call microservice ports (8081–8091) directly from browser code
- Store JWT in localStorage for production without threat review (sessionStorage OK for dev MVP)
- Add Redux — TanStack Query + Auth context is enough

## Run

```bash
cd frontend/investor-portal && npm install && npm run dev
```

Gateway `:8080` must be up. Demo login: `investor@tokenrealty.com` / `investor123`.
